{"id":10555,"date":"2017-06-15T10:21:33","date_gmt":"2017-06-15T10:21:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/?p=10555"},"modified":"2025-03-25T14:44:35","modified_gmt":"2025-03-25T14:44:35","slug":"hire-developers-in-liechtenstein","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-liechtenstein\/","title":{"rendered":"What Does It Cost to Hire Developers in Liechtenstein?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Liechtenstein is considered <a href=\"https:\/\/www.encyclopedia.com\/places\/germany-scandinavia-and-central-europe\/austria-political-geography\/liechtenstein\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" title=\"\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">one of the richest countries<\/a> in the world, that is if you compare its GDP to its low population. According to CIA, the estimated GDP for Liechtenstein in 2014 was five billion dollars.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Of course, if you compare that number to another European country like the UK then it\u2019s not a big deal. Do keep in mind though that it is more of a microstate rather than a country. Its population is only <a href=\"http:\/\/www.worldometers.info\/world-population\/liechtenstein-population\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">38,000 people<\/a>, truly a microstate.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"808\" height=\"334\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/liechtenstein-software-engineer-salary.png\" alt=\"Liechtenstein Software Engineer Salary\" class=\"wp-image-52800\" title=\"liechtenstein software engineer salary\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Much Does a Liechtenstein Developer Make on Average?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Developers in Liechtenstein charge much, and the main reason is that&nbsp;IT sphere&nbsp;is not the main industry in the&nbsp;country. According to a research that <a href=\"http:\/\/www.averagesalarysurvey.com\/liechtenstein\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Average Salary Survey<\/a> performed, to hire developer in Vaduz (capital of Liechtenstein) you\u2019ll have to give a salary of about $93,000 per year (gross). So, the Vaduz developer is not a cheap specialist.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Those who took the survey had a Master\u2019s degree and at least two to four years of experience in software development. There is probably no need to mention that they also were permanent workers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>So, is that all? You just give $93,000 and you have a Vaduz developer in your service? Well, not exactly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That is only the average salary of a Liechtenstein developer, which means that some developers will charge more or less based on the technologies they are skilled at and the work experience that they already have. Moreover, most small companies will need at least three to five developers in order to be productiv<\/span>e.&nbsp;In this case, the cost of Liechtenstein developer is multiplied by 3-5 times.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group developers-in-countries\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading dev-countries-title\">FIND AND EMPLOY DEVELOPERS IN OTHER COUNTRIES<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"dev-countries-text\">Expand your team&#8217;s capabilities by recruiting top-tier developers from around the world. This approach allows you to leverage diverse skills and cultural perspectives, enhancing innovation and technical excellence in your projects.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group dev-countries-items\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group dev-countries-item\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full dev-countries-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-luxembourg\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"602\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Luxembourg.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55769\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large dev-countries-flag\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/LU-Luxembourg.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55171\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"dev-countries-name\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-luxembourg\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">Luxembourg<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group dev-countries-item\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full dev-countries-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-mexico\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/04\/Mexico.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55659\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large dev-countries-flag\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/MX-Mexico.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55195\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"dev-countries-name\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-mexico\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">Mexico<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group dev-countries-item\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full dev-countries-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-norway\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Norway.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55776\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large dev-countries-flag\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/NO-Norway.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55205\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"dev-countries-name\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-norway\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">Norway<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group dev-countries-item\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full dev-countries-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-sweden\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Sweden.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55780\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large dev-countries-flag\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/SE-Sweden.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55236\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"dev-countries-name\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-sweden\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">Sweden<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group dev-countries-item\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full dev-countries-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-uae\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/UAE.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55736\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large dev-countries-flag\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/AE-UnitedArabEmirates.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55032\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"dev-countries-name\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-uae\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">UAE<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Much Does It Cost To Hire a Liechtenstein Dedicated Team?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>To be more specific, a Vaduz dedicated team. Although there are different cities where developers work, we decided to use the data on developers salaries based on the capital of Liechtenstein as it is its main city.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As mentioned before, to hire developers in Liechtenstein, you\u2019ll need at least $90,000 to $100,000 per year. The average Liechtenstein software engineer salary has seen a notable increase over the past few years, reflecting the country&#8217;s growing tech industry. In order to form a Liechtenstein dedicated team, you\u2019ll need to pay 3-5 times more than that amount.<br>That would be about $500,000 and is not a small price to pay indeed. Consider the fact that this is the average salary, there is a good chance that the pay is going to be even greater than that.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What Now?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/contact-us\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"965\" height=\"546\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Mobilunitys-Cooperation-Models.webp\" alt=\"Flexible Cooperation Models for Hiring Developers with Mobilunity\" class=\"wp-image-74940\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>It\u2019s perfectly understandable that a great number of experts are not willing to spend that amount of money. So, what now? The answer is to use <a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/dedicated-teams\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">dedicated team services<\/a> or hiring developers in Liechtenstein. You can <span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;hire dotnet developers&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:515,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;12&quot;:0}\">hire dotnet developers<\/span> with lower wages, a great amount of money can be saved.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>So, by hiring a <a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/cost-to-hire-developers-in-ukraine\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">remote developer from Ukraine<\/a> or choosing Liechtenstein, you save more money.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Don\u2019t hesitate to get in touch with us and inquire for CVs of developers from our pipeline!<\/h3>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Liechtenstein is considered one of the richest countries in the world, that is if you compare its GDP to its low population. According to CIA, the estimated GDP for Liechtenstein&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":39732,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[21,6091,6132],"tags":[],"ppma_author":[8143],"class_list":["post-10